1
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,950
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,416 --> 00:00:53,930
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:55,930
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,952 --> 00:00:58,880
=Episode 7=

5
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:01,359
Useless!

6
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,319
How come he was acquitted?

7
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:06,840
This...

8
00:01:07,719 --> 00:01:09,079
came from higher up too.

9
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:13,599
He really might be Mian.

10
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:15,560
Mian?

11
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:16,959
He's trash.

12
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:18,239
He's just a knockoff Mian.

13
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,799
Whether he is the real one or not,

14
00:01:23,359 --> 00:01:24,640
we can't underestimate him.

15
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:26,159
We need to think this through.

16
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,760
Now that he's free again,

17
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,319
everyone who's crossed him

18
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,200
could be in danger.

19
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,439
Hey, Wu Suowen.

20
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:39,599
You mean...

21
00:01:46,439 --> 00:01:47,159
Have someone else

22
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,200
do the killing.

23
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,040
Hey.

24
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:55,200
What is it?

25
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:56,920
Officer.

26
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:59,120
Can I go in and give my buddy some food?

27
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,039
Who?

28
00:02:16,159 --> 00:02:16,479
Zhou Yan.

29
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:18,479
Zhou Yan?

30
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,639
Don't bother.

31
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:20,240
Get back to work.

32
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:21,280
Huh?

33
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:25,520
They say Suowen wants him dead.

34
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:28,919
So he's already gone?

35
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,919
My buddy...

36
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,919
You died without even
getting a warm meal!

37
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:41,919
All your favorites.

38
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,159
Stop crying.

39
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,560
Keep crying and you'll bury him.

40
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,080
- Idiot.
- Ma Ding?

41
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:56,639
What are you doing here?

42
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,599
Yan!

43
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:01,319
Thank God you're alive!

44
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:03,919
How did you get out?

45
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,680
Did you use some Huaguo magic?

46
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,560
Could you not jinx me for once?

47
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:07,960
Talk later.

48
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,879
Wait.

49
00:03:17,759 --> 00:03:18,360
Come on.

50
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,800
Let's go.

51
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,680
That's Natuo's car.

52
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,000
You just got out,
and he's already after you?

53
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,039
Hurry! Go!

54
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,360
Hey.

55
00:03:46,439 --> 00:03:46,719
Come on.

56
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:47,479
Say hello to Mian.

57
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,400
Hello, Mian.

58
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,520
Mian's back.

59
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,280
You're not riding in this junk, are you?

60
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:54,479
Come on.

61
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,400
We set up a little party

62
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,479
to welcome you back.

63
00:03:57,759 --> 00:03:58,520
Mr. Natuo,

64
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,599
since you're being so kind,

65
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,479
I'd be rude to refuse.

66
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:03,039
Hey.

67
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:03,960
Please.

68
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,319
What's going on?

69
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:13,240
How did he become Mian?

70
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:34,920
Hey.

71
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,279
You're here too?

72
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:38,160
You knew Zhou Yan got out today too?

73
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,399
No idea.

74
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,120
There's plenty I don't know.

75
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,920
Zhou Yan's Mian now.

76
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:44,680
What?

77
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,439
Zhou Yan is Mian now?

78
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,240
Where... where is he?

79
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:51,680
Natuo invited him to Grand Royal.

80
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:52,839
He's in trouble.

81
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:54,959
This is bad.

82
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,040
Then get some rest, Mian.

83
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,600
I'll wait in the VIP room.

84
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,199
Please.

85
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,199
- Boss.
- Boss.

86
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:27,879
Mr. Mian.

87
00:06:28,319 --> 00:06:29,879
Mr. Natuo sent me to attend to you.

88
00:06:31,759 --> 00:06:32,360
Finally.

89
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:38,959
I've been waiting for you.

90
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:55,600
What are you doing?

91
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,439
If we don't make this convincing,

92
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,199
Natuo's men won't believe it.

93
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:04,000
Are you Mian or not?

94
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:12,680
What are you doing now?

95
00:07:13,839 --> 00:07:15,959
That scar's from a razor blade, right?

96
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:18,839
How do you know that?

97
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:30,319
Mian's scar came from a shotgun blast.

98
00:07:30,959 --> 00:07:31,839
It's nothing like yours.

99
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,519
Why are you posing as him?

100
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,279
All I can tell you is...

101
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,600
I don't mean any harm.

102
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:39,839
They ruined Sihan

103
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,439
and tried to kill me.

104
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,920
I can only fight back
in a way they fear.

105
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:46,920
I see.

106
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:48,839
I'm sorry.

107
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,319
Mr. Mian,

108
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,560
you can save that for later.

109
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,879
The bosses are waiting for you.

110
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,279
Be good.

111
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,040
Wait for me.

112
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,480
Boss Suowen.

113
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,200
That loser can't be Mian.

114
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,759
Get his heart.

115
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,200
Take him out.

116
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,039
Then it's over.

117
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,279
No one has ever seen
what Mian really looks like.

118
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Whether he's real or fake,

119
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:48,120
we'll all judge for ourselves.

120
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,840
If he really is Mian,

121
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:54,759
we can show him our loyalty.

122
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:56,639
Better pick the right side.

123
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,720
But then again,

124
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,879
if he isn't Mian,

125
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:04,000
we'll put him down

126
00:09:05,279 --> 00:09:05,639
like a dog.

127
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,600
Jia's right.

128
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,120
Yeah.

129
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,240
Let's see how he dies.

130
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:16,360
Gentlemen.

131
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,200
Mr. Mian is here.

132
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:26,919
Mian, our dear Boss.

133
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,679
Greetings.

134
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:39,399
Everyone.

135
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,639
This is

136
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,279
Langia's legendary Mian.

137
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,480
Let me introduce him.

138
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:54,720
This is our...

139
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:55,960
knockoff Mian.

140
00:10:00,799 --> 00:10:01,519
You're dead.

141
00:10:03,279 --> 00:10:03,960
Everyone in this room

142
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,639
is a big shot.

143
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,639
You're a human trafficker.
You don't get a say.

144
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,320
Mian's been missing for years.

145
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,639
Langia's been

146
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:17,600
a ship without a captain.

147
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:18,799
Now that Mian is back,

148
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:21,039
we've got a reason to celebrate.

149
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:21,639
Come on.

150
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,039
If you're the real deal,

151
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,679
from now on, I'm your best bro.

152
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,120
But if you're a fake,

153
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:36,879
this drink

154
00:10:37,799 --> 00:10:39,159
will be your last.

155
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:43,120
Then you're the one drinking it.

156
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,919
I'll toast you. You're Mian, after all.

157
00:10:54,799 --> 00:10:55,639
Mr. Mian.

158
00:10:56,279 --> 00:10:57,919
I'll do the honors and pour you a drink.

159
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,200
Come on.

160
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:04,840
Drink.

161
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:06,919
Take your time.

162
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:07,720
Drink.

163
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:08,960
Drink!

164
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,759
Dashan.

165
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:11,919
Take it easy.

166
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,480
You don't trust him,

167
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:16,000
but surely you trust everyone here?

168
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,639
Greetings.

169
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,279
I trust all of you.

170
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,000
Sorry.

171
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:21,960
I'll head back to my seat.

172
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,519
I need to cool off.

173
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,120
If you're really Mian,

174
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,360
let me ask you something.

175
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,440
Five years ago...

176
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:29,879
Do you remember it?

177
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:34,440
Mian and Natuo's father
had history back then.

178
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,279
If you're really Mian,

179
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,080
you should remember it.

180
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,879
If you don't have an answer,

181
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,679
we'll do this by the old rules.

182
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:50,399
The Hundred-Cut Punishment.

183
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:51,679
Impostors

184
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:53,799
must take 101 cuts.

185
00:11:54,799 --> 00:11:55,799
If you're still alive,

186
00:11:56,519 --> 00:11:57,120
count yourself lucky.

187
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,360
If you don't make it,

188
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:00,879
that's your fate.

189
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:04,639
Still no answer?

190
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,720
Will you do it yourself,

191
00:12:11,399 --> 00:12:12,200
or should we?

192
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,360
Jia.

193
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,120
You old geezer.

194
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,679
If impostors take 101 cuts,

195
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,639
shouldn't you pay back

196
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:25,519
the 101 cuts you owe me first?

197
00:12:27,559 --> 00:12:28,159
What do you mean?

198
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:31,320
Three years ago,
I punished his father, Songcai.

199
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:33,120
Because

200
00:12:33,559 --> 00:12:35,159
he brought in goods behind my back
and didn't kick up my cut.

201
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:36,360
Am I right?

202
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,159
But you never know

203
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:40,759
he was behind the whole thing.

204
00:12:43,399 --> 00:12:44,039
How is that possible?

205
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,559
I always backed Boss Songcai.

206
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:49,720
He was the one
who put your father up to it.

207
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,879
I just punished him for it.

208
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:53,799
But when the truth came out,

209
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,679
he ran your father down with his car.

210
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:04,759
Jia.

211
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,039
Is he telling the truth?

212
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,399
Mr. Natuo.

213
00:13:09,399 --> 00:13:10,120
You...

214
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:10,919
You know me.

215
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:11,840
Old geezer.

216
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:13,799
Am I right?

217
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:15,639
Natuo.

218
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,840
The man who ran down your dad
is right in front of you.

219
00:13:18,519 --> 00:13:19,480
Are you a coward?

220
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,159
Everyone's watching.

221
00:13:27,399 --> 00:13:27,840
Mr. Natuo.

222
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,720
You can't do this to me!

223
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,200
I did it all for...

224
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:43,559
Someone!

225
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,320
Get him out of here.

226
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:54,559
All right.

227
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,960
Can we start the welcome party now?

228
00:13:57,519 --> 00:13:57,919
Wait.

229
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,399
You claim to be Mian.

230
00:14:04,879 --> 00:14:05,639
These two scars...

231
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:06,879
Do you remember them?

232
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,120
Six years ago,

233
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:12,799
I crossed Mian

234
00:14:13,519 --> 00:14:15,120
and got these two scars.

235
00:14:16,159 --> 00:14:16,759
Do you know

236
00:14:17,519 --> 00:14:18,200
who gave them to me?

237
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:21,399
Only Mian and I know what happened.

238
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,159
If you're Mian,

239
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:24,919
you won't have forgotten that.

240
00:14:35,919 --> 00:14:37,240
(Both scars are on his ribs.)

241
00:14:37,879 --> 00:14:38,399
(Could it be...)

242
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,039
(the Two-Blade Oath?)

243
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:42,879
You stabbed yourself twice.

244
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,960
My rule in Langia was this:

245
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,799
To earn forgiveness from one
of your own, take a blade to each side.

246
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,120
You've always been hard on yourself.

247
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:52,919
So those two scars

248
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:54,919
were your apology to me.

249
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:03,440
Right!

250
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:04,919
Right!

251
00:15:05,919 --> 00:15:07,279
You got it half right!

252
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,440
These two scars...

253
00:15:11,279 --> 00:15:12,240
I stabbed myself for one,

254
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,639
and Mian stabbed me for the other.

255
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,120
Back then, I wanted to follow Mian.

256
00:15:18,279 --> 00:15:20,600
I took a blade to each side
to prove my loyalty.

257
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:24,639
He helped me with one.

258
00:15:26,559 --> 00:15:27,200
He said

259
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,879
I wasn't worthy to be one of his own.

260
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,440
And you actually said

261
00:15:35,759 --> 00:15:36,919
I was one of Mian's own?

262
00:15:55,796 --> 00:15:57,396
♪Dust rises along the border♪

263
00:15:57,396 --> 00:15:58,716
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

264
00:15:58,716 --> 00:16:00,076
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

265
00:16:00,076 --> 00:16:01,476
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

266
00:16:01,476 --> 00:16:02,836
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

267
00:16:02,836 --> 00:16:04,156
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

268
00:16:04,156 --> 00:16:05,476
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

269
00:16:05,476 --> 00:16:07,156
♪My life is mine to bear♪

270
00:16:07,636 --> 00:16:09,996
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

271
00:16:09,996 --> 00:16:12,596
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

272
00:16:12,916 --> 00:16:14,916
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

273
00:16:14,916 --> 00:16:15,996
♪My fate is mine to command♪

274
00:16:16,356 --> 00:16:17,276
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

275
00:16:17,516 --> 00:16:18,556
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

276
00:16:18,796 --> 00:16:19,876
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

277
00:16:20,076 --> 00:16:21,156
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

278
00:16:21,396 --> 00:16:22,516
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

279
00:16:22,716 --> 00:16:23,836
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

280
00:16:24,036 --> 00:16:25,156
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

281
00:16:25,356 --> 00:16:26,436
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

282
00:16:26,676 --> 00:16:27,796
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

283
00:16:28,196 --> 00:16:29,316
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

284
00:16:29,596 --> 00:16:30,716
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

285
00:16:30,956 --> 00:16:32,076
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

286
00:16:32,196 --> 00:16:35,116
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

287
00:16:37,396 --> 00:16:38,796
♪With blood and sweat♪

288
